@startuml SSD US 2.2.1 - Update Vessel Type
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam sequence {
  ActorBorderColor #000000
  ActorBackgroundColor #87CEEB
  ParticipantBorderColor #000000
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #87CEEB
  LifeLineBorderColor #000000
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #87CEEB
}

actor "Port Authority Officer" as Officer
participant "«system (C4)»\nPort Operations System" as System

activate Officer
Officer -> System : 1: request to update a Vessel Type
activate System
System --> Officer : 1.1: search and filter by name/description\n(select Vessel Type to update)
deactivate System

Officer -> System : 2: select Vessel Type
activate System
System --> Officer : 2.1: show current data\n(name, description, capacity,\nconstraints: max rows, bays, tiers)
deactivate System

Officer -> System : 3: provide updated data
activate System
System --> Officer : 3.1: validate and save changes\nconfirmation shown; changes reflected in vessel registration\nand in search results
deactivate System

deactivate Officer
@enduml
